  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 1.4.2:\n      - Preserves DI registration order in diagnostics for order-sensitive mediator registrations.\n      - Keeps diagnostics payload-safe while making processor, behavior, exception-flow, and notification order easier to review.\n      - Adds regression coverage for diagnostics report and Markdown registration ordering.\n      - Full changelog: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n      - GitHub releases: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/releases",
